    <tags>turso tursodb sqlite database cli embedded-database rust</tags>
    <summary>Command-line interface for tursodb, a SQLite-compatible embedded database</summary>
    <description>Turso is an in-process SQL database, compatible with SQLite, written in Rust.

This package installs `tursodb.exe`, the Turso CLI, allowing you to create and interact with Turso/SQLite-compatible database files directly from the command line.

Binaries are downloaded at install time directly from the official [tursodatabase/turso GitHub releases](https://github.com/tursodatabase/turso/releases) and are not embedded in this package.

By default `tursodb.exe` is extracted into this package's own tools folder under `%ChocolateyInstall%\lib\tursodb`. To install to a custom location instead, pass an `InstallDir` package parameter:

    choco install tursodb --params "'/InstallDir:C:\tools\tursodb'"

`tursodb` is put on PATH via a Chocolatey shim regardless of which location is used.</description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/tursodatabase/turso/releases</releaseNotes>
  </metadata>
</package>
